; EXODUS.BIN: Ultima III (Origin 1983, PC version by James R. Van Artsdalen).
; Generated by tools/gen.py; tools/build.py builds it (MASM, LINK, then the image from 0100).
; ACTIONS: Word, Cmd, Insert, Dig, Search, Bribe, Pray (7458-7AEA).
;
; Code: the Yell command (CmdYell: the word of power EVOCARE crosses the Great Serpent) and the
; Other command (CmdOther), which reads a word and dispatches INSERT (CmdInsert: the four cards into
; Exodus, the end of the game), DIG (CmdDig: the Exotic weapon and armour), SEARCH (CmdSearch: a
; card at a shrine), BRIBE (CmdBribe: a guard for 100 gold) and PRAY (CmdPray: the Evocare hint)
; through the tables at 6540 (words) and 654C (handlers).
; Data from 76E6 on: the dungeon facing steps, the dungeon event handlers, the dungeon
; command table (DungeonKeys, DungeonCmds, DungeonPrompts), the town service table (77CE),
; and the strings and menus of HAND (Hand Equipment) and EQUIP: weapon and armour menus,
; the class limits for readying and wearing, the error texts, Transact's words, the chest
; and trap messages.
CODE SEGMENT BYTE PUBLIC
ASSUME CS:CODE, DS:CODE, ES:CODE, SS:CODE
